 *
 * This test validates the following behaviors for the configuration deletion API:
 * 1. Creation of a new configuration using POST /discussionboard/configurations.
 * 2. Hard-deleting the configuration by its UUID with DELETE /discussionboard/configurations/{id} and ensuring no response body.
 * 3. Verifying, via PATCH /discussionboard/configurations, that the deleted configuration does not appear in search/list results.
 * 4. Confirming that a subsequent attempted deletion of the same (already deleted) configuration results in a 404 error.
 * 5. Attempting to delete with an invalid/malformed UUID and ensuring proper error handling.
 */
export async function test_api_discussionboard_configurations_test_delete_configuration_by_id_and_handle_missing_records(
