 * 3. Submit the moderation report and confirm that all returned record fields match the request values
 * 4. Attempt to submit an invalid report by omitting a required field (reporting_member_id), and confirm the correct error is returned
 *
 * This test ensures both positive (valid creation) and negative (missing required field) behaviors are validated for moderation report workflows on comments.
