 *
 * This test ensures that a post snapshot can be permanently deleted by an authorized administrator, with immediate removal and no possibility of soft restoration, in accordance with the schema that lacks soft-delete support. As part of the process:
 *
 * 1. Create a post as the source for snapshotting.
 * 2. Create a post snapshot associated with the post.
 * 3. Delete the snapshot by ID using the admin-only endpoint.
