 *    - Expect: success: false, message present ("not found" or similar)
 * 2. Attempt deletion with an obviously invalid UUID format (e.g. not even a UUID)
 *    - Expect: error is thrown or response is error (depending on implementation)
 * 3. Validate that only defined fields (success, message) are present in error response
 */
