 *
 * This test ensures that a post reference created between two posts can be
 * retrieved by its id, and that all fields in the returned object match the
 * originally supplied creation data. This validates the correctness of both
 * the create and get-by-id API endpoints, as well as schema field integrity.
 *
 * Steps:
 * 1. Create a new post reference between two posts using the POST endpoint.
 * 2. Fetch the newly created reference by its id via GET endpoint.
